Z||000000||AusFiero||06-09-2001||04:46 AM||||Well I decided to look into some Australian local pricing on many accessories as apposed to your American ones. Guess what, everything is pretty much cheaper here due to the exchange rate. Gear knobs, sports steering wheels with adapters to suit Fieros, driving lights, pedals etc etc.<P>So I decided to contact a branch of Australias 3rd largest auto parts and accessories sellers and have kicked up a deal with them to sell online, a huge range of accessories to suit most makes. <P>Am currently building the new online store for these and my own products. All prices will be in USA dollars and will include shipping to USA and Canada.<P>Stay tuned for some accessory prices in the coming weeks that I think should really impress you's compared to what you are paying now.<P>Have also kicked up a deal on other Fiero suspension parts that I should hopefully able to supply cheaper than you can buy them  currently. Again will include shipping and prices so far look like they will be cheaper than your current USA prices which you then have to add freight too.<P>Stay tuned for the release of <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>www.auto-alley.com</A>  . Don't visit that URL now though because while I am building it will only redirect you straight to my web design business site.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
